    },
    "body": "The native writer previously treated `Where is selvi? Explain in a sentence. Answer:` as an `Explain → a sentence` fact. Its masked endpoint features were identical to a genuine fact proposal. This adds one offline-learned contextual lexical-prime feature, with only nonpositive coefficients, while preserving the complete writer, certified NoWrite cache, H4/zeta geometry, source correction and shared word/numeric operators. The same words remain valid factual payloads in factual contexts; no serving phrase rules, templates, provider or matrix products are added.\n\nRetain artifact `169f23ef` (`blake3:169f23efd1babd314deed5cd523953179d94a8eb9dbf6e930892e57080a85828`), SHA256 `3594003cc8265a31f5fe512ab38cd68289f5255769f30cf254f1fc7028e00260`. The outer witness reconstructs parent `82662f85` byte-identically and enforces the coefficient sign, dictionary, row and identity constraints. The disabled-feature control follows actual ingestion and reproduces that parent.\n\nExecuted local validation:\n\n- Writer correction/parent-output preservation: 825/825 construction comparisons, including 64 balanced cases. These are not 825 independently correct language answers.\n- Complete history correctness: 12/12 versus parent 8/12. Four instruction records are removed; all legitimate records, selected sources and output bytes remain exact.\n- Post-selection fixed-form comparisons: 32/32, comprising 26 new-prompt identity cases and six repeated factual cue controls; no later refit.\n- Retained answers: 663/663; word construction/open/prior transfer 132/132, 28/28, 24/24; source positions 40/40; original abstention 10/10. Fourteen earlier semantic/control reports match exactly, including negative interventions.\n- Native API: 176 passing checks. Focused tests: 32 unique passes, including the integer-kernel source guard and seven actual-artifact allocation/checkpoint checks. Actual generated Copy/Add Rust equalities and retained identifier-return fragments compile and execute.\n- Release/offline builds of changed core examples and API; formatting, diff whitespace and claim-wording checks pass.\n\nThe factual cue control still emits the parent's malformed prose despite retaining the correct fact. Both prior overflow targets retain their wrong text/EOS. General prose, general instruction understanding, reasoning, Rust synthesis, alpha and energy advantage remain unqualified. New-artifact browser/WASM/HTTP and blanket suite/Clippy are not run. Measured zero allocation excludes load/encoding/session/checkpoint/JSON work; artifact startup remains about 26 seconds.\n\nResource use: 1,748.183 model seconds and 552.355 engineering-command seconds. Cumulative model use is 22,232.042 / 25,050 seconds; prior 196.620-second reservation preserved. Necessary +2,700-second and +2 GiB limits were recorded before use under standing authorization. Storage receipt retains the 128 MiB stop margin and all prior charges. No unique deletion or paid external compute.\n\nThe result/evidence documents and current-state pointer contain artifact/source/command/resource receipts and the next bounded step: compositional owner/value field emission through the shared selector, using distinct owner-first requests while preserving value-first behavior.\n\nThe five PR/merge-group compatibility acknowledgements execute no tests; local executed checks above carry validation.\n\nReferences #973. References #820. General language acceptance remains open.\n",
